  55:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h **** /**
  56:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * @defgroup CO_driver Driver
  57:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * Interface between CAN hardware and CANopenNode.
  58:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  *
